## Why This Is Asked

End-to-end tests for multi-tenant data pipelines must validate deterministic inputs, failure scenarios, and dashboard correctness under realistic conditions. These tests challenge system reliability by combining data isolation, scheduled execution, and eventual consistency requirements.

## Key Concepts

- Tenant isolation via headers or subdomains
- Deterministic test data using fixtures and mocks
- Idempotent reruns and retry mechanisms
- Failure injection and eventual consistency verification
- Tooling strategy between Playwright and Cypress

